        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Character in Any Scene\n\n**Character in Any Scene** places a reference portrait into a new setting and animates the resulting frame.\n\n1. **Character Photo**, **Character Descriptor**, and **Scene Prompt** drive **ImageToImage** so the character's identity carries into the new environment.\n2. **ImageToVideo** animates that scene keyframe using your chosen **Camera Move**."
        },
